Chart 10: Facility distribution map (geographic dot map)
What: Facilities dataset with LGA polygon geometry. Sport (categorical), facility location (spatial).
Why: Explore spatial distribution — show where facilities are across Victoria and identify geographic gaps.
How: Geographic dot map; LGA area marks provide context, point marks show facilities, colour hue encodes sport. Interactive filter isolates each sport's footprint. Map idiom is required as position is part of the data.
